flowchart TD
    subgraph RN ["RenderNode (Native C++ 物件結構)"]
        direction TB
        subgraph HP ["1. Header Properties (可變資料，更新耗時 < 1 µs)"]
            direction TB
            HPList["• translationX, translationY<br/>• scaleX, scaleY<br/>• rotationX, rotationY, rotationZ<br/>• alpha, elevation, pivotX, pivotY"]
        end

        subgraph DL ["2. Display List (繪製指令，錄製完成後不可變)"]
            direction TB
            DLList["• drawRect(0, 0, 100, 100)<br/>• drawText('Hello')<br/>• drawBitmap(...)"]
        end
    end

    HP -.->|硬體矩陣變換| GPU["GPU RenderThread<br/>(直接套用 4x4 矩陣，重播 Display List)"]
    DL -->|無需重新錄製| GPU

